    <string name="money_disclaimer">SplitSaathi is an expense tracking and accountability manager. We NEVER hold, pool, or transfer money, and we have no wallet or payment gateway. Users settle directly via their own UPI apps. All amounts shown are internal accounting records, not verified bank balances.</string>
